<statement>
<p>
Find the reduced row echelon form (RREF) of the given matrix using row operations.</p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{\left[\begin{array}{cccc} {1}\amp{3}\amp{1}\amp{1}\\-{2}\amp-{6}\amp{0}\amp{2}\end{array}\right]}</m></p>
<p>
<fillin characters="20"/>   </p>
</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li><m>\displaystyle{\left[\begin{array}{cccc} {1}\amp{3}\amp{0}\amp-{1}\\{0}\amp{0}\amp{1}\amp{2}\end{array}\right]}</m></li></ul></p>
</answer>

</myopenmath>